He will not send you back into it [i.e., the sea] another time and send upon you a hurricane of wind and drown you for what you denied? Then you would not find for yourselves against Us an avenger.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"17:70","t":"And We have certainly honored the children of Adam and carried them on the land and sea and provided for them of the good things and preferred them over much of what We have created, with [definite] preference.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":70,"sd":null},{"k":"17:71","t":"[Mention, O Muḥammad], the Day We will call forth every people with their record [of deeds]. Then whoever is given his record in his right hand - those will read their records, and injustice will not be done to them, [even] as much as a thread [inside the date seed].","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":71,"sd":null},{"k":"17:72","t":"And whoever is blind in this [life] will be blind in the Hereafter and more astray in way.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":72,"sd":null},{"k":"17:73","t":"And indeed, they were about to tempt you away from that which We revealed to you in order to [make] you invent about Us something else; and then they would have taken you as a friend.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":73,"sd":null},{"k":"17:74","t":"And if We had not strengthened you, you would have almost inclined to them a little.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"17:75","t":"Then [if you had], We would have made you taste double [punishment in] life and double [after] death. Then you would not find for yourself against Us a helper.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":75,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":29,"surahs":[17],"sajdah":false}